{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Run away from me: Alexandra",
    "steam_appid": 2904970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/60f8d626399b1a41aa444a7d2dd113c3.avif?t=1754072923\" width=1600 height=1388 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/7ab6cfd1d9f3c61712aaee8c755a3e51.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>Alexandra, a lonely girl, after a grueling week at work, decides to plunge into the world of nightlife to celebrate her friend's birthday. In the club, her gaze is caught by the mysterious and charismatic Eric - a wealthy man with a charm that is impossible to tear yourself away from. This night promises to be exciting... spotlights, dancing, the noise of the crowd... unexpectedly, everything begins to float before Alexandra\u2019s eyes and the world around her plunges into darkness...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/14779802d20b1c4ef7e8a838e5594aae.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/33924ef7262b18a896e6171e44750f08.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Alexandra knows the value of trust - it must be earned. Raised in a single-parent family, she was used to relying only on herself and her mother, with whom they faced the world together. This hardening made her strong and independent, but at the same time distrustful of others. What will happen when her familiar world turns upside down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/97c3c232e40de0a4ec5932e39829d5c3.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eric has everything - power, strength, connections, opportunities. A rich and successful businessman who inherited his father's business, which he managed to develop into a global giant. Alas, these things no longer bring him pleasure. The only joy available to him is hunting, power over prey, decisions between life and death. And Alexandra should be his first and only failure in his life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/50eb8e2698af00e52bd2c05e4795878b.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rustam, a native of Uzbekistan. Works for Eric Mikhailovich as long as he can remember. Faithful servant, chain dog. &quot;Cleaner&quot;. Pursues his goals, for the sake of a better future for his family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/f379a416d6883d6d59e8e11a6278fdbd.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>In the game RAFM. Alexandra (Run away from me. Alexandra) we decided to move away from standard notes, papers, stickers, newspaper clippings and other things. Instead, we offer you a unique concept based on interaction with various gadgets - everything in the game will interact with the player through a fitness bracelet and a phone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.mp4?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight, inventory, pedometer, breathing tracking - everything you need to complete the game is integrated directly into the gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.mp4?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/9946c88a6daee48bda41fc891dcd7f69.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>You decide what the end of this story will be. But be careful: not everything is so clear. Reveal the secret and find out who the real victim is in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/8f427deb68b6ca5fc0f626c8d978b6ae.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/8f427deb68b6ca5fc0f626c8d978b6ae.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/8f427deb68b6ca5fc0f626c8d978b6ae.mp4?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/55d866fa31b76b0bd0e42d6ff64bbb1e.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>\u2022 \u2713 Intellectual tasks: Logical puzzles require analytical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Multifaceted antagonist: The maniac's personality is gradually revealed, adding new facets to understanding his motives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Unusual plot: Stories with unexpected twists and screamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Blink effect: Enhanced perception of the game's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Cultural context: References to art, cinema and literature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Main role: Dasha Ostrovskaya as Alexandra Kuprina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Alternative endings: Your choice affects the outcome of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Easter eggs from the developers are included in the cost of the game</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/60f8d626399b1a41aa444a7d2dd113c3.avif?t=1754072923\" width=1600 height=1388 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/7ab6cfd1d9f3c61712aaee8c755a3e51.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>Alexandra, a lonely girl, after a grueling week at work, decides to plunge into the world of nightlife to celebrate her friend's birthday. In the club, her gaze is caught by the mysterious and charismatic Eric - a wealthy man with a charm that is impossible to tear yourself away from. This night promises to be exciting... spotlights, dancing, the noise of the crowd... unexpectedly, everything begins to float before Alexandra\u2019s eyes and the world around her plunges into darkness...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/14779802d20b1c4ef7e8a838e5594aae.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/33924ef7262b18a896e6171e44750f08.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Alexandra knows the value of trust - it must be earned. Raised in a single-parent family, she was used to relying only on herself and her mother, with whom they faced the world together. This hardening made her strong and independent, but at the same time distrustful of others. What will happen when her familiar world turns upside down?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/97c3c232e40de0a4ec5932e39829d5c3.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eric has everything - power, strength, connections, opportunities. A rich and successful businessman who inherited his father's business, which he managed to develop into a global giant. Alas, these things no longer bring him pleasure. The only joy available to him is hunting, power over prey, decisions between life and death. And Alexandra should be his first and only failure in his life.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/50eb8e2698af00e52bd2c05e4795878b.avif?t=1754072923\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rustam, a native of Uzbekistan. Works for Eric Mikhailovich as long as he can remember. Faithful servant, chain dog. &quot;Cleaner&quot;. Pursues his goals, for the sake of a better future for his family. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/f379a416d6883d6d59e8e11a6278fdbd.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>In the game RAFM. Alexandra (Run away from me. Alexandra) we decided to move away from standard notes, papers, stickers, newspaper clippings and other things. Instead, we offer you a unique concept based on interaction with various gadgets - everything in the game will interact with the player through a fitness bracelet and a phone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/57fec83f05bd6df0ddf583350d245e0c.mp4?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight, inventory, pedometer, breathing tracking - everything you need to complete the game is integrated directly into the gadgets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.mp4?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/9946c88a6daee48bda41fc891dcd7f69.avif?t=1754072923\" width=610 height=136 /></span>You decide what the end of this story will be. But be careful: not everything is so clear. Reveal the secret and find out who the real victim is in this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/8f427deb68b6ca5fc0f626c8d978b6ae.poster.avif?t=1754072923\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/8f427deb68b6ca5fc0f626c8d978b6ae.webm?t=1754072923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak